    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1839 the first cotton mill powered by Hope Mills Dam was completed, launching the town’s textile era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hope_Mills%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the mid‑1840s the Rockfish Factory had become North Carolina’s largest cotton mill by capital and production value.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
